From 5260f57885d05937d10939e98c111deae0aad3b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Slaapliedje <25948081+slaapliedje@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:34:20 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec: add H.264 MVC (3D) decoding via edge264-mvc

---
 configure                  |   4 +
 libavcodec/Makefile        |   1 +
 libavcodec/allcodecs.c     |   1 +
 libavcodec/libedge264mvc.c | 245 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 251 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 libavcodec/libedge264mvc.c

